ies, and address any anomalies, specifically the sole proprietorship designation.\n\n\nThe \"결산월\" field is blank for sole proprietors, and the business's industry classifications are \"부동산업\" (real estate) for the large and medium categories, and \"부동산 임대 및 공급업\" (real estate rental and supply) for the small category, respectively. The source data's employee count of 3 is accurate according to the original data, however, the business is closed. I will keep the original employee count and note \"폐업\" (closed) in the remarks.\n\n\n"}
